          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ખંડેર (khanḍer) probably goes back to khaṇḍitaghara, \"a broken house\", a form CDIAL reconstructs, where it lists Gujarati khãḍiyer, \"ruins\" (CDIAL 3798). It is what is left when walls and roofs have fallen."
