          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "વસવું (vasvũ) is inherited from Sanskrit vásati, \"dwells\", and CDIAL lists the Gujarati verb, \"settles\" (CDIAL 11435). People વસે છે where they make their homes; રહેવું is everyday living."
            }
